Usage: agent-deck completion <bash|zsh|fish>

Print a shell completion script for agent-deck's commands, subcommands,
and resource names (sessions, remotes, profiles, groups, agents) to stdout.

  Bash:  echo 'source <(agent-deck completion bash)' >> ~/.bashrc
  Zsh:   echo 'source <(agent-deck completion zsh)' >> ~/.zshrc
         (or save as a file named '_agent_deck' in a directory on $fpath)
  Fish:  agent-deck completion fish > ~/.config/fish/completions/agent-deck.fish

Open a new shell (or re-source the config file) afterwards.
